 Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Carroll County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 36 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle got 41% of normal in September to October and 47% in January to February. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grids 26559, 26560 and 26561 at 58%. For grid 26560, the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 182.7, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
